89 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 71 0 R
/E (Sycophancy refers to when AI is overtly agreeable and flattering to the user, even if the information is wrong. This results in confirmation bias within the user, where users are less and less exposed to opinions outside of their own, and believe that they are right, even if it is incorrect.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
