105 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (AI bias happens when an ingrown human bias embeds itself into the Artificial Intelligence as well. This happens because the data reflects a societal bias, and this is in turn reflected into the AI model itself. We are what we eat, and AI is what we feed it.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
106 0 obj
<<
