107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (One of the most common ways human bias makes its way into AI systems is when the data used to train the AI is not diverse or representative of actual populations. AI developers and corporations must make active steps to collect a broad range of data that is not skewed towards certain demographics.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
108 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Data Labeling)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
