109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Before the data is used to train the AI system, the data needs to be labelled. This means that subjective topics can be influenced by the personal or cultural opinions of the individual labeling the data. An example of this would be facial expressions, each person may have different interpretations of a certain expression.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
