/P 77 0 R
/E (AI psychosis is characterized by AI amplifying or validating or even causing delusions. These delusions can be related to paranoia, conspiracy, seeking romantic partnership in AI chatbots and more. AI chatbots are not designed to recognize unhealthy mental health signals from users, and due to their sycophantic tendencies, they often enhance psychosis instead of mitigating or helping.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
