>>
endobj
231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (The sycophantic nature of AI chatbots can lead to AI agreeing and encouraging things that should not be encouraged, and may convince those who are more vulnerable to acting upon such dangerous advice. This is often called a delusion spyral, where due to the constant confirmation bias provided by the AI, the user continues to become even more immersed in their own delusions.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
