endobj
248 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 78 0 R
/T <FEFF0048006900730074006F0072006900630061006C0020004800650061006C007400680063006100720065002000440061007400610020219200200042006900610073>
/E <FEFF0048006900730074006F0072006900630061006C0020004800650061006C007400680063006100720065002000440061007400610020219200200042006900610073>
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (Artificial Intelligence Agents have weeded into various parts of the medical field, such as streamlining diagnostic processes, lifting administrative burdens, and developing new drugs and vaccinations. As AI slowly integrates into almost all areas of the healthcare system, the concern of AI biases and flaws have become increasingly serious. Healthcare is one of the most important areas in which AI is being implemented. This is because this field is especially dangerous if potential biases arise, since it is directly connected to the lives of patients.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (When training AI models, large amounts of data is required to achieve accuracy. However, wthin these large datasets, there are demographics that are often absent or misrepresented, leading to the AI models perpetuating existing biases that already existed in healthcare. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (Most medical studies in the past have been done on white males, meaning that certain treatments are less effective for demographics that are outside of that category. An example of this is the pulse oximeter. The pulse oximeter measures the saturation of oxygen by passing infrared light through the skin of the patient. It has been found that pulse oximeters systematically overestimate the oxygen saturation of non-white patients.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (Furthermore, these biases can lead to some patients receiving better care than other patients due to their race or gender. Historically more money is spent on white patients rather than black patients even when they have the same illness, therefore AI programs have been seen to misunderstand that black people are healthier and may prioritize white patients for treatments of life threatening diseases. This creates a vicsious cycle where human instilled biases result in AI bias which inturn train future AI models that reflect the same bias.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (These biases do not only apply to races and ethnicities, it also applies to gender. Most medical experiments and tests have been done on male patients, which means that there are existing societal biases between men and women in healthcare.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (A prominent example of this is cardiology. Heart attacks are overwhelmingly misdiagnosed in women, due to heart conditions presenting differently between males and females. Therefore AI models that claim to predict the likelyhood of heart attacks in an individual within the next 5 years may be inaccurate when predicting for women.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
